#### `ExpirationConfiguration`

**Defines the *document expiration* configuration of a database.**

```php
class ExpirationConfiguration
{
    bool $disabled
    ?int $deleteFrequencyInSec
}
```
<br />

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| **disabled** | `bool` | Set to `false` to enable *document expiration* for the database, or to `true` to disable the feature.<br />The default value is `false`. |
| **deleteFrequencyInSec** | `?int` | The interval, in seconds, between the feature's checks for documents whose expiration time has passed.<br />The value must be greater than 0.<br />If `null`, the default value of 60 seconds applies.<br />On a Community license, the value must be at least 129600 (36 hours). See [Enabling document expiration](../../../documents/document-expiration/client-api.mdx#enabling-document-expiration). |

